## Project Overview

Build a Full Stack Calculator application.

The application consists of:

Frontend
- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Axios
- Responsive UI

Backend
- Go
- REST API
- JSON responses
- Layered architecture

Communication

The frontend MUST communicate with the backend through HTTP REST.

The frontend must NEVER calculate any mathematical operation locally.

Every calculation must be executed by the backend.

