## Backend Requirements

Language

Go

Architecture

cmd/
internal/
    handlers/
    services/
    models/
    validator/
    middleware/

Responsibilities

Handlers

- HTTP layer only
- Parse requests
- Validate payloads
- Return HTTP responses

Services

- Business logic only

Models

- Request and response models

Validator

- Input validation

Middleware

- Logging
- Recovery
- Future extensibility

The business logic should never exist inside HTTP handlers.

